# Rookery Stacks (CIPlay rookery_stacks): the soup kitchen, the petition, the rats, the smithy (titanium tools), the
# tollgate, the screechers, the packer's hut (advanced backpack), three water tokens in the barrels (one on the key, two
# on the roofs), the elders' plan, their chest (electric zipline tool), the storm warning; the treasure.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Rookery Stacks
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Lowest Roofs
zone soup_kitchen
expect step 1
read Rookery petition
expect step 2
kill Rat
expect animals Rat 0
expect step 3
open Rookery smithy
wait 3
expect step 4
zone tollgate
expect step 5
kill Screecher
expect animals Screecher 0
expect step 6
open Packer's hut
wait 3
expect step 7
openat 1.65 -14.6
openat -20.6 -49.1
openat -4.8 -55.5
expect story watertoken 3
expect step 8
read Rookery elders' plan
expect step 9
open Elders' hut
wait 3
expect step 10
zone gull_stacks
expect step 11
read Bathhouse slate
expect step 12
open Family van's crate
wait 3
expect step 13
read Storm warning
expect done
dig
